# openyaga -- deny by default.
#
# This working folder also holds the game itself, a disc image, a ScummVM
# checkout and ~600 MB of extracted artwork.  None of that belongs in git, and
# game-derived source must NEVER be committed, so nothing is tracked unless it
# is explicitly listed below.  An accidental `git add -A` adds nothing new.

/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!FORMATS.md
!tools/
!player/

# Reconstructed game source: a derivative work of the original program.
# It belongs only on a machine that owns the game.  Never commit it.
game-source/
player/gamecache/

# Generated output -- reproducible from tools/, too big to track.
extracted/
extracted-cards/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
player/a5.png
player/a45.png
player/anim_*.png
player/chk_*.png
player/in1.png
player/noclick.png
player/click.png
